file: "packages/core/src/pipeline/render_pipeline.ts"
doc:
  "Shared render pipeline. renderPipeline gains an optional Delta: given one, it draws the union of a diagram and what the Delta says was deleted.\n"
  "\n"
  "Vocabulary for this file is fixed in delta_overlay.spec.textproto.\n"
  "\n"
  "ONLY renderPipeline changes. layoutPipeline, which shares this file, is not\n"
  "touched at all: the diff treatment runs on layoutPipeline's OUTPUT rather\n"
  "than inside it, so nothing has to be threaded through it."

methods: [
  { name: "renderPipeline"
    change_type: MODIFIED
    doc:
      "MODIFIED: gains a fifth parameter, `delta`. Omitted, every existing\n"
      "caller behaves exactly as before and none needs editing.\n"
      "\n"
      "When `delta` is undefined the body is unchanged: layoutPipeline, then\n"
      "SvgRendererImpl().render.\n"
      "\n"
      "When `delta` is defined, three things are inserted around that same\n"
      "pair, and layoutPipeline is still called exactly once:\n"
      "  BEFORE layoutPipeline:\n"
      "    overlay = mergeDelta(diagram, delta)\n"
      "    seeded  = seedComponentBindings(overlay.diagram, stylesheet,\n"
      "              themes.get('default'))\n"
      "    layoutPipeline is then called with overlay.diagram and `seeded`,\n"
      "    NOT with the `diagram` and `stylesheet` parameters. Passing the\n"
      "    originals would lay out a graph containing none of the deleted\n"
      "    elements, and the render would show none of them.\n"
      "    When `stylesheet` is undefined, seedComponentBindings is given a\n"
      "    newly created empty Stylesheet with schemaVersion 1, as renderOp\n"
      "    does.\n"
      "  AFTER layoutPipeline, before the render:\n"
      "    applyDiffPalette(laidOut, overlay, themes.get('default')?.tokens)\n"
      "\n"
      "WHY THE TREATMENT RUNS AFTER LAYOUT. It has to run after\n"
      "resolvePipeline, because until that returns the values it would read\n"
      "are still token reference strings rather than colours -- and\n"
      "resolvePipeline is called inside layoutPipeline. Running it on\n"
      "layoutPipeline's result rather than partway through means this file's\n"
      "other function is untouched. It costs nothing: every LaidOut type\n"
      "carries the same styling fields as the Resolved type it wraps, and the\n"
      "treatment changes colours, one dash pattern and one fill opacity,\n"
      "never a size or a shape -- so it could not have changed what layout\n"
      "computed had it run earlier.\n"
      "\n"
      "`themes` is keyed by BINDING NAME, not by theme name. 'default' is the\n"
      "reserved binding every stylesheet has -- per style.proto's comment on\n"
      "Stylesheet.themes, an unqualified `component` resolves against it --\n"
      "and resolveThemes guarantees an entry for it, falling back to\n"
      "[['default', 'dark']] when a stylesheet binds nothing. So\n"
      "themes.get('default') is a lookup for whichever theme is bound as the\n"
      "default, NOT for a theme literally named \"default\".\n"
      "\n"
      "Seeding must see the union, which is why it is repeated here rather\n"
      "than left to the caller. renderOp seeds against the diagram it loaded,\n"
      "which contains none of the deleted elements, so a restored node tagged\n"
      "`kind: database` would otherwise arrive with no component and fall\n"
      "back to the theme default -- drawn as a plain rectangle beside\n"
      "surviving cylinders.\n"
      "\n"
      "ERRORS are unchanged: layoutPipeline's Err propagates with whatever\n"
      "stage name it carried, and a render failure returns Err with stage\n"
      "'render'. mergeDelta, seedComponentBindings and applyDiffPalette each\n"
      "return their value directly rather than a Result, so there is nothing\n"
      "to check after them."
    is_async: true
    inputs: [
      { name: "diagram",      type: { named: { symbol: "archeglyph.content.v1.Diagram" } } },
      { name: "stylesheet",   type: { unsupported: { reason: UNION_AT_TYPE_POSITION, source_excerpt: "Stylesheet | undefined" } } },
      { name: "themes",       type: { named: { symbol: "ReadonlyMap", args: [{ primitive: CHARACTER }, { named: { symbol: "archeglyph.theme.v1.Theme" } }] } } },
      { name: "layoutEngine", type: { named: { symbol: "LayoutEngine" } } },
      { name: "delta",        type: { named: { symbol: "archeglyph.content.v1.Delta" } }, is_optional: true }
    ]
    output: { named: { symbol: "archeglyph.util.Result", args: [
      { primitive: CHARACTER },
      { named: { symbol: "PipelineError" } }
    ]}}
    uses: ["layoutPipeline", "SvgRendererImpl", "mergeDelta", "seedComponentBindings", "applyDiffPalette"]
  }
]
